      "blocks": [
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 63,
          "text": "1. Purpose"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 87,
          "text": "This policy defines the methodology used to measure the value of Order Intake for multi-element arrangements,"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 102,
          "text": "including allocation of contract value across deliverables using Standalone Selling Price (SSP)."
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 129,
          "text": "2. Scope"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 156,
          "text": "Applies to all multi-element customer arrangements combining:"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 174,
          "text": "- Hardware/Software (HW/SW) deliverables, AND"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 192,
          "text": "- Services deliverables"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 225,
          "text": "3. Definitions"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 249,
          "text": "Standalone Selling Price (SSP): The price at which the Company would sell a deliverable separately under similar"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 261,
          "text": "circumstances."
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 291,
          "text": "4. Roles and Responsibilities"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "table",
          "top": 313.5,
          "rows": [
            [
              "Role",
              "Responsibility"
            ],
            [
              "Deal Desk",
              "Prepares SSP allocation calculations"
            ],
            [
              "Finance Manager",
              "Reviews allocations exceeding variance threshold"
            ],
            [
              "Pricing Team",
              "Maintains standard list price catalogue"
            ]
          ],
          "n_rows": 4,
          "n_cols": 2
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 411,
          "text": "5. SSP Allocation Methodology"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 438,
          "text": "5.1 Calculation Basis"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 459,
          "text": "Allocation is performed using the Standalone List Price method. Each deliverable is allocated a share of total contract"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 471,
          "text": "value based on its list price relative to total list price of all deliverables. No weighting adjustment is applied."
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 495,
          "text": "5.2 Allocation Formula"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 516,
          "text": "SSP Allocation (Deliverable) = (List Price of Deliverable ÷ Total List Price of All Deliverables) × Total Contract Value"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 546,
          "text": "6. Sample Allocation Illustration"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "table",
          "top": 568.0,
          "rows": [
            [
              "Deliverable",
              "Contract Value",
              "SSP",
              "SSP Allocation"
            ],
            [
              "HW/SW",
              "30",
              "30",
              "27.90"
            ],
            [
              "Services",
              "1",
              "10",
              "3.10"
            ],
            [
              "Total",
              "31",
              "40",
              "31.00"
            ]
          ],
          "n_rows": 4,
          "n_cols": 4
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 651,
          "text": "The allocation reflects a proportional split based on the list price ratio of 30:10, applied against total contract value of"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 663,
          "text": "31."
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 693,
          "text": "7. Approval Requirements"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 750,
          "text": "CFO POLICY FRAMEWORK | CONTROLLED DOCUMENT Page 2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_number": 3,
      "extraction_method": "text",
      "char_count": 462,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 63,
          "text": "Allocations resulting in variance greater than 20% from standard list price ratios require Finance Manager sign-off"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 75,
          "text": "prior to booking."
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
